Sometimes table cells contain information beyond that extracted via `html_text()`, which is what is run on each cell in `html_table()`.  For instance, some table cells might contain links. Would you accept a PR that allows extraction of the full HTML contents of cells?

This would take the form of an additional argument to `html_table()` (`html_contents`), that would be FALSE by default.

